(7229765, 1117717, 156466, '<td valign="top">Something distracting going on with the shadows and the edit - like there''s a blur or motion.  Not sure if that''s what you were going for, but I find it distracting.</td>', 'Something distracting going on with the shadows and the edit - like there''s a blur or motion.  Not sure if that''s what you were going for, but I find it distracting.', '2014-06-17 11:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
