(7230002, 1117292, 60173, '<td valign="top">I like that whatever is going on in the foreground becomes almost a soft mist. There''s even a little rainbow in there. This is a delicate image, and the foreground softness really adds to the overall feel for me.</td>', 'I like that whatever is going on in the foreground becomes almost a soft mist. There''s even a little rainbow in there. This is a delicate image, and the foreground softness really adds to the overall feel for me.', '2014-06-17 19:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7230007, 1117907, 70270, '<td valign="top">As a starting point, I''d give this photograph about a 6.  Nicely composed, good detail, very well processed, and a sorta interesting subject.  +1 for actually putting people on the bench.  and +1 again for putting one of them in Giants gear.  (If it was an A''s hat I''d have to give you -1; a Dodger''s hat would have been an automatic DQ :-).)  Final score: 8</td>', 'As a starting point, I''d give this photograph about a 6.  Nicely composed, good detail, very well processed, and a sorta interesting subject.  +1 for actually putting people on the bench.  and +1 again for putting one of them in Giants gear.  (If it was an A''s hat I''d have to give you -1; a Dodger''s hat would have been an automatic DQ :-).)  Final score: 8', '2014-06-17 19:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
