(7231746, 1117668, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Fantastic angle that really showcases the details and lines of this bench! Interesting quote stamped on the surface - makes one stop and look. Nicely done.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Fantastic angle that really showcases the details and lines of this bench! Interesting quote stamped on the surface - makes one stop and look. Nicely done.', '2014-06-22 11:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231747, 1117093, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great B&amp;W tones and good details- very interesting bench. It looks very uncomfortable to lie down on though given the cramped posture of the gent trying to chillax:-)</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great B&W tones and good details- very interesting bench. It looks very uncomfortable to lie down on though given the cramped posture of the gent trying to chillax:-)', '2014-06-22 11:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231750, 1117306, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great long exposure shot to tell an interesting story of what this bench might have seen! I like how you chose to tell a story that is an added bonus to the just a shot of a park bench at night. The apparition sits in anguish on this lone bench - what ails him is/was a mystery. It would have been even more spooky if no shadow was cast but one has to work with what one has and if the park lights sit where they are to cast the light and shadows very little can be done.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great long exposure shot to tell an interesting story of what this bench might have seen! I like how you chose to tell a story that is an added bonus to the just a shot of a park bench at night. The apparition sits in anguish on this lone bench - what ails him is/was a mystery. It would have been even more spooky if no shadow was cast but one has to work with what one has and if the park lights sit where they are to cast the light and shadows very little can be done.', '2014-06-22 11:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231752, 1117290, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I like the story idea and the angle of the bench adds visual interest. I think you could have gotten at a lower angle that the bench filled the frame. The bench slates would <b>still</b> be going at a diagonal like you have the beginnings here but the leading lines would be stronger because it would fill the frame and lead the eye directly to the left behind floral bouquet. I think it would be better visually if the flowers were in sharp focus like that of the bench. Hmmm, I wonder it the story would have an even stronger emotional impact if the flowers were wilted showing the passage of time - he waited a long time but she never came.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I like the story idea and the angle of the bench adds visual interest. I think you could have gotten at a lower angle that the bench filled the frame. The bench slates would still be going at a diagonal like you have the beginnings here but the leading lines would be stronger because it would fill the frame and lead the eye directly to the left behind floral bouquet. I think it would be better visually if the flowers were in sharp focus like that of the bench. Hmmm, I wonder it the story would have an even stronger emotional impact if the flowers were wilted showing the passage of time - he waited a long time but she never came.', '2014-06-22 11:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231753, 1117543, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to bump up and to comment.<br/> <br/>Great colors and clarity. Nice find that the sheep was taking shelter under the bench either that -  or it is hiding from the big, bad wolf:-) Composition is great with the bench and the sheep taking center stage. The bench offers shelter to this lone sheep. It has seen much given the weathered texture on it''s wooden surface.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to bump up and to comment. Great colors and clarity. Nice find that the sheep was taking shelter under the bench either that -  or it is hiding from the big, bad wolf:-) Composition is great with the bench and the sheep taking center stage. The bench offers shelter to this lone sheep. It has seen much given the weathered texture on it''s wooden surface.', '2014-06-22 11:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231756, 1117789, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to bump up and comment<br/> <br/>Great find! Love how the lines of the bench stretch off into the horizon. They act as leading lines that the eye follows to observe the span of the bridge above moving off in the same direction off to the horizon. The lines of the bench and the bridge compliment one another. B&amp;W was a good choice for it elevates the eyes attention to the lines of the composition without competition of color that may detract attention away.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to bump up and comment Great find! Love how the lines of the bench stretch off into the horizon. They act as leading lines that the eye follows to observe the span of the bridge above moving off in the same direction off to the horizon. The lines of the bench and the bridge compliment one another. B&W was a good choice for it elevates the eyes attention to the lines of the composition without competition of color that may detract attention away.', '2014-06-22 11:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
