(7232232, 1117292, 60173, '<td valign="top">Congrats! I''m dying to know what made the rainbow in the foreground.</td>', 'Congrats! I''m dying to know what made the rainbow in the foreground.', '2014-06-23 12:47:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7232264, 1117292, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by aliqui:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats! I''m dying to know what made the rainbow in the foreground. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>There were flowers in front of me but I think it is lens flare. Sun is to my right and I am clear of the building. The lens hood wasn''t in place. It shows only on this frame. I think I lucked out.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-06-24 01:44:15.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by aliqui: Congrats! I''m dying to know what made the rainbow in the foreground.   There were flowers in front of me but I think it is lens flare. Sun is to my right and I am clear of the building. The lens hood wasn''t in place. It shows only on this frame. I think I lucked out.', '2014-06-23 13:41:13.000000', '2014-06-24 02:44:15.000000', 0);
